ns are unable to synthesize vitamin B2/riboflavin and must obtain it via intestinal absorption (PubMed:20463145). (Microbial infection) May function as a cell receptor to retroviral envelopes similar to the porcine endogenous retrovirus (PERV-A)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}